{{#> layout title="Your card details code"}}
  <h1>Your card details code</h1>
  <p>Hi {{name}},</p>
  <p>Use this code in the SaveApp merchant portal to see a card's full number, expiry date and CVV.</p>
  {{> code code=code}}
  <p>This code expires in {{expiryMinutes}} minutes.</p>
  <p class="muted">If you didn't ask to see card details, don't share this code and tell your business Owner straight away.</p>
{{/layout}}
